			"width": 907,
			"height": 568
		},
		{
			"id": "f850ed3589e9a577",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "最後因為是有可能是從 ALU 或是 Memo，寫入到 Reg 的話那就需要一個 MUX 來幫助選擇",
			"x": 1198,
			"y": 2200,
			"width": 404,
			"height": 55,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "9a585656346e8401",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "這邊會從 Reg 直接把內容寫到  Read data2 -> Memory",
			"x": 1219,
			"y": 2973,
			"width": 250,
			"height": 60,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "4e3f68b7d9fbe19d",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_2_Datapath_construction/20-Branch Instructions.png",
			"x": 370,
			"y": 3240,
			"width": 548,
			"height": 400
		},
		{
			"id": "a2fe18727b9100b4",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_2_Datapath_construction/21-Branch Instructions.png",
			"x": 1100,
			"y": 3260,
			"width": 552,
			"height": 360
		},
		{
			"id": "babca48fb2aa308e",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_2_Datapath_construction/22-Branch Instructions.png",
			"x": 1780,
			"y": 3260,
			"width": 532,
			"height": 360
		},
		{
			"id": "69f6c72319d9d445",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "- **PC+4**：分支指令先跳到下一條 → 1000 + 4 = 1004。\n    \n- **offset=3**：這裡的 3 不是 byte，而是「3 條指令」，簡單來說就是為了要同步**單位**",
			"x": 1156,
			"y": 3720,
			"width": 441,
			"height": 91,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "df9b61feaac149fb",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "最後用 MUX 區分出是要從 PC+4 後的結果還是要從 Beq 指令後的結果去更新 PC",
			"x": 1877,
			"y": 3756,
			"width": 339,
			"height": 55,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "6dce1a8beeb510c3",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "加完 S0 直接存 T0 ",
			"x": 385,
			"y": 1370,
			"width": 185,
			"height": 50,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "061b488b0bb43521",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "ALUSrc 0 的時候，直接從輸入加入選擇資料就不從 reg 選擇資料了",
			"x": 760,
			"y": 1370,
			"width": 250,
			"height": 85,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "e3627a9a059e4516",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_2_Datapath_construction/13-Load Instructions.png",
			"x": 370,
			"y": 1680,
			"width": 546,
			"height": 400
		},
		{
			"id": "b60663322b987ec7",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "- **位元寬度不一致**：暫存器與 ALU 都是 32 位元，而立即數只有 16 位元 → 必須擴展。\n    \n- **符號擴展而不是零擴展**：因為立即數可能是負數，必須保留正負號。也就是複製最高位元 (bit 15) 到擴展後的高 16 位。",
			"x": 1255,
			"y": 1370,
			"width": 520,
			"height": 121,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "c2f423ad8f8c7549",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_2_Datapath_construction/14-Load Instructions.png",
			"x": 1120,
			"y": 1680,
			"width": 559,
			"height": 400
		},
		{
			"id": "0e321e9c2e66b54d",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織_TOPIC_2_Datapath_construction/12-Jump 指令建構 Datapath.png",
			"x": 3013,
			"y": 1131,
			"width": 868,
			"height": 440
		},
		{
			"id": "900b4e1c2732de22",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "最後面量為直接接地然後，跟然後 PC+4 直接取代原本的位置，這樣也正常因為這樣才知道要跳到哪邊",
			"x": 4018,
			"y": 1308,
			"width": 250,
			"height": 115,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "d2f490a656ddbd92",
